model optimizer: Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B on ovms (GPU), metadata from huggingface
  dense qwen3_5, 27781427952 params -> no MoE adjustment [https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B/blob/1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0/config.json]
  context 262144 tokens -> kept at the agent's own --max-model-len / OVMS default [https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B/blob/1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0/config.json]
  1 openvino-ir candidate(s); top: OpenVINO/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-ov [official] (default, asym) -> serve OpenVINO/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-ov@7b20ea8c7df7 [https://huggingface.co/OpenVINO/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-ov/blob/7b20ea8c7df7223a85ff27bab5c473f0cb038943/openvino_config.json]
  model family qwen3_5 -> tool parser qwen3coder, reasoning parser qwen3 [https://recipes.vllm.ai/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B (--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder --reasoning-parser qwen3); https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/model_server/blob/main/docs/llm/reference.md (qwen3coder + qwen3)]
  chat template thinks on by default -> OVMS has no server-side default: agents send chat_template_kwargs {"enable_thinking": false, "reasoning_effort": "medium"} per request (k3d-gpu's own warm-up request sends enable_thinking false) [https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/model_server/blob/v2026.4.1/docs/model_server_rest_api_chat.md (L223)]
  card: non-thinking sampling min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=1.5, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.7, top_k=20, top_p=0.8 -> ovms reads generation_config.json (the thinking-mode values) and has no server override: clients send these with thinking off [https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B/blob/1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0/README.md (L253)]
  vision tower in the IR -> loaded as a VLM pipeline: OVMS refuses LM on a VLM directory [https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/model_server/blob/v2026.4.1/src/llm/servable_initializer.cpp (L588-641)]
  OpenVINO/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-ov bundles openvino_mtp_model.xml; OVMS MTP needs prefix caching off and forces greedy -> MTP off: prefix caching stays on (EXPERIMENTS.md H25 SUPPORTED: added-agent TTFT 9.4x faster with it); MTP (1.78x at n=2 in OpenVINO's notebook, greedy only, max_tokens required) is unmeasured on agent turns here. K3D_GPU_AGENT_DRAFT=mtp turns it on [https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/model_server/blob/v2026.4.1/demos/continuous_batching/speculative_decoding/README.md (L30); EXPERIMENTS.md H25]
  variant ranking (official > RedHatAI > community/self-built; a lower rank wins only when measured better):
